WEBVTT

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:05.179
<v Nuri>There are tracks in the sand. Can you point to them?

00:00:05.529 --> 00:00:07.458
<v Nuri>Whose tracks are these?

00:00:11.308 --> 00:00:15.237
<v Nuri>Here is a real camel. See if you can find its hump.

00:00:16.837 --> 00:00:20.366
<v Nuri>Watch its foot. One step leaves one print.

00:00:22.116 --> 00:00:26.285
<v Nuri>The camel has reached the water. Look, it bends down for a drink.

00:00:28.035 --> 00:00:30.444
<v Nuri>Whom did we find by following the tracks?

00:00:33.944 --> 00:00:37.793
<v Nuri>A camel! Let’s thank Allah for creating camels.
